{"version":1,"content":"<p>在矽谷與世界論壇上，ASML總裁兼CEO克裏斯託夫・富凱，當着美國副國務卿赫爾伯格表達觀點，反對切斷對華DUV光刻機售後維護服務。他認為即便ASML工程師撤出國內晶圓廠，設備也不會停擺，很快會有其他技術人員接手維修工作。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587812.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.399118+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:48:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"fdec24a6a4e6f01306f37c42f8064b5242ae3dc7413a9db9dd538642eb9fe24f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}